  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nGiven : **26 ÷ 24 + 6 × 27 - 105 = 29**\n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the signs :\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : × and ÷\n\n26 × 24 + **6 ÷ 27**__ - 105 = 29\n\n__**26 ×**____** 24**__ + 0.22 - 105 = 29\n\n__**624 + 0.22**__ - 105 = 29\n\n__**624.22 - 105**__ = 29\n\n**519 **≠** 29 (LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• **Option - (2) : + and ÷**\n\n26 + **24 ÷ 6**__ × 27 - 105 = 29\n\n26 + __**4 × 27**__ - 105 = 29\n\n__**26 + 108**__ - 105 = 29\n\n__**134 - 105**__ = 29\n\n**29 = 29 (LHS RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : + and ×\n\n**26 ÷ 24**__ × 6 + 27 - 105 = 29\n\n__**1.08 ×**____** 6**__ + 27 - 105 = 29\n\n__**6.48 +**____** 27**__ - 105 = 29\n\n__**13.48 - 105**__ = 29\n\n**-91.52 ≠ 29 (LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : × and -\n\n**26 ÷ 24**__ + 6 - 27 × 105 = 29\n\n1.08 + 6 - __**27 **____**×**____** 105**__ = 29\n\n__**1.08 + 6**__ - 2835 = 29\n\n__**7.08 - 2835**__ = 29\n\n**-2827.92 ≠ 29 (LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\nHence, \"Option - (2)\" is the correct answer.",
